<title>USA: Cali Realty buying office buildings.</title>
<headline>Cali Realty buying office buildings.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said Monday that it has acquired four office buildings in suburban Philadelphia for $72.5 million.</p>
<p>Cali said it bought the properties from Beacon Properties Corp. They total 444,000 square feet and are 97 percent leased.</p>
<p>The purchase was financed through one of Cali's credit facilities, the company said. The purchase also includes a 3.2 acre parcel zoned for another 24,000 square feet of development.</p>
